<div class="page-actions"><a class="back-link" href="<?= site_url('admin/peran') ?>">← Daftar peran</a></div><section class="form-panel"><div class="form-intro"><span class="panel-overline">HAK AKSES</span><h2><?= h($title) ?></h2><p>Centang tindakan yang boleh dilakukan peran ini. Izin selalu diperiksa pada setiap halaman dan aksi.</p></div><form method="post" action="<?= site_url('admin/peran/simpan') ?>"><?= csrf_input() ?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= h($row['id']??'') ?>"><div class="form-grid"><label>Kode peran <span class="required">*</span><input name="code" value="<?= h($row['code']??'') ?>" required maxlength="60" <?= isset($row['code'])&&$row['code']==='superadmin'?'readonly':'' ?>></label><label>Nama peran <span class="required">*</span><input name="name" value="<?= h($row['name']??'') ?>" required maxlength="100"></label><label class="check-label form-full"><input type="checkbox" name="active" value="1" <?= !$row || $row['active']?'checked':'' ?>> Peran aktif</label></div><div class="table-wrap permission-wrap"><table class="permission-table"><thead><tr><th>Modul</th><?php foreach ($actions as $label): ?><th><?= h($label) ?></th><?php endforeach; ?></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach ($modules as $m): ?><tr><td><strong><?= h($m['name']) ?></strong><small class="cell-sub mono"><?= h($m['code']) ?></small></td><?php foreach ($actions as $action=>$label): $key=$m['id'].'|'.$action; ?><td><input type="checkbox" name="permissions[]" value="<?= h($key) ?>" aria-label="<?= h($label.' '.$m['name']) ?>" <?= isset($permissions[$key])?'checked':'' ?>></td><?php endforeach; ?></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button button-dark">Simpan peran & izin →</button><a class="button button-quiet" href="<?= site_url('admin/peran') ?>">Batal</a></div></form></section>
